OSPF Routing (Open Shortest Path first)
- Multi -Vendor Dynamic Routing
-implements Dijkstra Algorithm - best path
-Administrative Distance of 110 hops
-Advertised by AREA.

OSPF states: DOWN > INIT >TWO-WAY> EX START > EXCHANGE > LOADING >FULL

DR- Designated Router 
BDR - Backup Designated ROuter
-(Non or DRother) - Router without special admin Duty

ABR-Area Boundary Router
ASBR - Autonomous System Boundaru Router

OSPF LSA (Link State Advertisement Types)
Type 1 LSA (Router LSA) - Advertising the "O"
Type 2 LSA ( Network LSA) - Advertise By Designated Router(DR) sh ip ospf nei
Type 3 LSA ( Summary LSA) - Advertising the "O IA" sh ip route ospf
Type 4 LSA (ASBR Summary LSA) Autonomous system Boundary Router - Metric
Type 5 LSA (AS External) -Advertising the "O" E2


Recipe:
router ospf number# <Process ID>
router-id <ip, mostly loopback>
network <Directly connected network> <wildcard of Directly connected network> Area number.
@R4
router-id 4.4.4.4 - loop back
